How to execute in Remix
1. Create Bank.sol.
2. Paste the code.
3. Compile using Solidity 0.8.20.
4. Select MetaMask → Sepolia.
5. Deploy the contract.
6. Set the Remix Value field to 0.005 ether.
7. Click deposit() → Confirm in MetaMask.
8. Click showBalance() → Call.
9. Enter 1000000000000000 in withdraw() (0.001 ETH).
10. Set Value back to 0 wei.
11. Click withdraw() → Confirm.
12. Call showBalance() again.

Expected balance after withdrawal:
0.004 ETH
4000000000000000 Wei

All the best
